{"id":1049,"date":"2020-10-07T13:51:12","date_gmt":"2020-10-07T13:51:12","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/?post_type=application&#038;p=1049"},"modified":"2025-04-07T19:00:19","modified_gmt":"2025-04-07T19:00:19","slug":"masters-of-machine-intelligence","status":"publish","type":"application","link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/application\/masters-of-machine-intelligence\/","title":{"rendered":"African Master\u2019s in Machine Intelligence"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover is-light has-background-dim-30 page-cover\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:#161228\"><\/span><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"750\" height=\"467\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-2158\" alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/File_005.jpeg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/File_005.jpeg 750w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/File_005-300x187.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/File_005-16x10.jpeg 16w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\">\n<h1 class=\"has-white-color has-text-color\">African Master\u2019s <strong>in<\/strong> Machine Intelligence (AMMI)<\/h1>\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"applications-modal row\">\n\n\n<div class=\"col-md-6 application-status   apps-closed\">\n\n <h3>Applications Closed<\/h3>\n\n\n <\/div>\n\n<div class=\"col-md-6 application-form\">\n\n <h3>Application Form<\/h3>\n\n\n <\/div>\n\n <\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group pad-5\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<h2>Overview<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The African Masters of Machine Intelligence program (AMMI) is a one-year intensive Master\u2019s program launched in 2018, thanks to the sponsorship of Facebook and Google, as well as the exceptional support of the global Artificial Intelligence community.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The program provides brilliant young Africans with state-of-the-art training in machine learning and its applications. AMMI prepares well rounded machine intelligence researchers who respond to both present and future needs of Africa and the world.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Every course on AMMI is lectured by leading experts in their fields, extraordinary teachers from prestigious international institutions, and dedicated mentors.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Applications are currently open so click on Application Form to apply.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Check the program\u2019s official website <a rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/aimsammi.org\/\" target=\"_blank\">here<\/a> <\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Overview The African Masters of Machine Intelligence program (AMMI) is a one-year intensive Master\u2019s program launched in 2018, thanks to the sponsorship of Facebook and Google, as well as the exceptional support of the global Artificial Intelligence community. The program provides brilliant young Africans with state-of-the-art training in machine learning and its applications. AMMI prepares<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"template":"","meta":{"advgb_blocks_editor_width":"","advgb_blocks_columns_visual_guide":""},"tags":[],"acf":[],"featured_img":false,"coauthors":[],"author_meta":{"author_link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/author\/rose\/","display_name":"rose"},"relative_dates":{"created":"Posted 5 years ago","modified":"Updated 8 months ago"},"absolute_dates":{"created":"Posted on October 7, 2020","modified":"Updated on April 7, 2025"},"absolute_dates_time":{"created":"Posted on October 7, 2020 1:51 pm","modified":"Updated on April 7, 2025 7:00 pm"},"featured_img_caption":"","tax_additional":{"post_tag":{"linke